  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Job Skills Training and Placement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fund will go towards empowering youths in Laikipia and Kilifi County who will receive training and skills to enable them fit in the hospitality industry through provision of agri-products and service. The fund will also be spent in putting up the required infrastructure (green house and classroom preparation), equipping six centers , paying trainers and setting up a business incubator program.</narrative>
  </description>
